SUMMARY:[POPL 2026] Paper Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:POPL 2026 seeks contributions on all aspects of programming la
 nguages and programming systems\, both theoretical and practical. Authors
  must omit their names and institutions from their paper submissions due 
 to full double-blind reviewing. References to authors' own prior work sho
 uld be in the third person. The submission site is https://popl26.hotcrp.
 com. Each paper should have no more than 25 pages of text\, excluding bib
 liography\, using the PACMPL format (specifically\, the acmart LaTeX clas
 s with acmsmall option). Concurrent paper submissions to other conference
 s\, workshops\, journals\, or similar forums of publication are not allow
 ed.\n\nSource: https://conf.researchr.org/track/POPL-2026/POPL-2026-popl-
 research-papers\nMaintenance: E003 - see https://github.com/JonasAlaif/pl
 -conferences/blob/main/MAINTENANCE.md
END:VEVENT
