SUMMARY:[SPLASH 2026 (OOPSLA)] R1 Paper Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Papers must be submitted via HotCRP at https://oopsla26.hotcrp
 .com/. Initial submissions must be at most 23 pages\; revisions can go up
  to 25 pages. PACMPL(OOPSLA) uses double-blind reviewing with two rounds 
 of review. At least one senior author must register as a reserve reviewer
  unless exempt. Papers accepted in either round will be published in the 
 2026 volume of PACMPL and invited to present in-person at the SPLASH conf
 erence in 2026\; remote presentations are not possible.\n\nSource: https:
 //2026.splashcon.org/track/oopsla-2026\nMaintenance: E003 - see https://g
 ithub.com/JonasAlaif/pl-conferences/blob/main/MAINTENANCE.md
END:VEVENT
